      "message": "[error] Line 175: 🔴 `showScreenAfterRemoving` still leaves `accountService.currentAccount` inconsistent in two paths: when `remainingAccounts.isEmpty` and when all remaining accounts require migration. In both cases, `currentAccount` can continue pointing to the removed account (or remain stale), while navigation proceeds to onboarding/migration. Set `currentAccount \u003d nil` in the empty branch and set it to `nextAccount` before emitting `.needAccountMigration` in the migration-required branch to keep in-memory account state aligned with persisted selection and avoid downstream logic using a deleted account.",
